        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lydia Davis, Raymond Carver\n- Works: Varieties of Disturbance\n- Topics: flash fiction, American short story\n\nFacts:\n- Raymond Clevie Carver Jr. was born on May 25, 1938, and he became an American short-story writer and poet.\n- Lydia Davis was born on July 15, 1947, and she is an American writer noted for literary works of extreme brevity commonly called flash fiction.\n- Raymond Carver contributed to the revitalization of the American short story during the 1980s.\n- Raymond Carver died on August 2, 1988.\n- Varieties of Disturbance is Lydia Davis's fourth collection of short stories.",
